  "text": "求累次积分的值：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\sqrt{\\pi/2}}\\left(\\int_y^{\\sqrt{\\pi/2}}\\cos(x^2)\\,dx\\right)dy$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "积分次序交换",
    "积分区域图示",
    "换元积分",
    "不能初等求出原函数的被积函数（$\\cos(x^2)$）"
  ],
  "question_type": "交换积分次序求累次积分",
  "method": [
    "画出积分区域",
    "交换dx,dy的积分顺序",
    "先积分与y无关的内层",
    "换元 $u=x^2$ 求外层积分"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "确定原积分区域：$0\\le y\\le\\sqrt{\\pi/2}$，$y\\le x\\le\\sqrt{\\pi/2}$，即 $0\\le y\\le x\\le\\sqrt{\\pi/2}$",
    "交换次序：先对y（从0到x）积分，再对x（从0到$\\sqrt{\\pi/2}$）积分",
    "内层积分得到 $x\\cos(x^2)$",
    "外层积分换元 $u=x^2$ 求得最终结果"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "swap_order_iterated_integral",
    "template": "\\int_0^{a}\\left(\\int_y^{a}\\cos(x^2)\\,dx\\right)dy,\\ a=\\sqrt{\\pi/2}",
    "variable_count": 1
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "問1(2)",
      "steps": [
        "原区域 $R=\\{(x,y):0\\le y\\le\\sqrt{\\pi/2},\\ y\\le x\\le\\sqrt{\\pi/2}\\}$，等价于 $0\\le y\\le x\\le\\sqrt{\\pi/2}$。",
        "交换积分顺序：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\sqrt{\\pi/2}}\\int_0^{x}\\cos(x^2)\\,dy\\,dx$。",
        "内层积分（被积函数与y无关）：$\\int_0^x\\cos(x^2)\\,dy=x\\cos(x^2)$。",
        "外层积分：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\sqrt{\\pi/2}}x\\cos(x^2)\\,dx$，令 $u=x^2,\\ du=2x\\,dx$，得 $\\tfrac12\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos u\\,du=\\tfrac12\\left[\\sin u\\right]_0^{\\pi/2}=\\tfrac12$。",
        "结论：原积分的值为 $\\dfrac12$。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
