        "交换次序验证"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "直接对内层积分计算",
        "对外层积分计算",
        "用交换次序法验证结果一致"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "swap_order_iterated_integral",
        "template": "\\int_0^1\\left(\\int_y^1 x\\,dx\\right)dy",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "直接法：内层 $\\int_y^1x\\,dx=\\tfrac{1-y^2}2$，外层 $\\int_0^1\\tfrac{1-y^2}2dy=\\tfrac12\\left(1-\\tfrac13\\right)=\\tfrac13$。",
            "交换次序验证：区域为 $0\\le y\\le x\\le1$，交换后 $\\int_0^1\\int_0^x x\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^1x^2dx=\\tfrac13$，与直接法一致。",
            "最终结果：$\\dfrac13$。"
          ]
        }
